    "created_at": "2023-01-03T23:28:26Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-01-03T23:28:26Z",
    "body": "I'm going to use this issue to track the specific request for providing a \"port name\" field in `getInfo()`. This is distinct from the \"device ID\" proposed in #128. I think both are necessary. The \"port name\" being a user-visible value that satisfies the user experience concern raised here while a \"device ID\" would be used internally be applications to track information about ports they have previously connected to. While a \"device ID\" would be guaranteed to be unique, over time many devices could have the same user-visible \"port name\". ",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
    "pin": null,
